   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "FOCUS\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 5, CC 97 to 109\n   1 Focus width\n   2 Focus shift\n   3 Narrow focus to Wide focus\n   4 Distraction\n   5 Fixation\n   6 suite: Tunnel vision\n   7 suite: Looks away at the wrong moment\n   8 suite: Narrowing in\n   9 pair: When a fixation tightens, the shots get closer\n  10 pair: When a distraction pulls hard, something is missed\n  11 pair: When attention starts narrowing, it hardens into a fixation\n  12 pair: When a character's attention shrinks to one thing, they miss the warning\n  13 pairs: Eyes on one thing"
   },
   "pos": [
    0,
    0
   ]
  },
